# Local development environment variables.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in real values.
# `wrangler dev` loads `.env` automatically and exposes the values on
# `c.env` in your Worker code. `.dev.vars` is also supported — use one
# or the other, not both.
#
# After adding or removing variables, run `npm run cf-typegen` so the
# `CloudflareBindings` interface stays in sync.
#
# For production, set secrets with: npx wrangler secret put <NAME>
# Non-secret config belongs in the "vars" section of wrangler.jsonc.

API_MOTD="Hello world!"
